  data: {
    LLM: "As Dealer (Quota 7): Call a trump suit where you have length and the Big Joker. You need a lot of tricks. As Short Hand (Quota 4): Play defensively. You only need 4 tricks to save yourself, 5 to score.\n\nThe Pluck Advantage: If you are plucking an opponent, always ask for Trumps or a suit you are strong in. Taking their Ace of Trumps secures your lead.\n\nDefensive Drilling: If you are the 'Short' hand (Quota 4), lead suits that the Dealer is likely weak in to prevent them from reaching their high quota of 7.",
    Player: "As Dealer (Quota 7): Call a trump suit where you have length and the Big Joker. You need a lot of tricks. As Short Hand (Quota 4): Play defensively. You only need 4 tricks to save yourself, 5 to score.\n\nThe Pluck Advantage: If you are plucking an opponent, always ask for Trumps or a suit you are strong in. Taking their Ace of Trumps secures your lead.\n\nDefensive Drilling: If you are the 'Short' hand (Quota 4), lead suits that the Dealer is likely weak in to prevent them from reaching their high quota of 7.",
